## Main
    Let mutable xs be a new Seq of Int.
    Let mutable i be 1.
    While i is at most 20:
        Push i * i to xs.
        Set i to i + 1.
    Show the length of xs.
    Show item 5 of xs.
    Let mutable total be 0.
    Let mutable j be 1.
    While j is at most 20:
        Set total to total + item j of xs.
        Set j to j + 1.
    Show total.
